<h2><span class="secno">5.</span>Results</h2>

<h3><span class="secno">5.1</span>Load-dependent thermal crossover</h3>

<p class="noind">Holding motion amplitude constant, the thermal penalty of out-of-band command power
depends on how hard the joint is already working.</p>

<div class="tbl">
  <p class="lab">Table 1</p>
  <p class="ttl">Thermal dissipation relative to \(\rho = 0\) across static load levels (three seeds).</p>
  <div class="tw">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Static load</th><th>\(\rho=0.02\)</th><th>0.05</th><th>0.10</th><th>0.20</th><th>0.40</th></tr></thead>
